        "Use less wrist extension and less assistance for an easier option. This retains the app variation with fingers up; Rouland35 on p.36 shows a different forearm rotation with fingers down. It is not an exact reproduction or an equivalent demand for comparisons. Choose the hold duration manually in the plan."
