          "Clear space on a firm non-slip floor; a mat is optional for comfort. One reach and return is one repetition on that side. In new prescriptions identify the side by the raised leg; the opposite hand reaches toward it. A right-and-left pair is one repetition per side, not two on each. Historical L/R labels and counts are not relabelled."
